.TH LAUNCH-CONVERGENCE 1 "2026-08-07" "launch-convergence" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
launch-convergence \- launch the Convergence Mass Effect 3 mod under MangoHud
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B launch-convergence.sh
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B launch-convergence.sh
is a small bash wrapper that launches the Convergence mod for Mass Effect 3
under
.BR mangohud (1).
.P
It changes to the game directory
.IR ~/Games/ConvergenceER\ 3.0.1/me3
and runs:
.IP
.EX
mangohud me3 launch -p ./convergence.me3
.EE
.P
The
.B me3
binary in that directory is the game executable; the
.B launch
subcommand with the
.B \-p
flag starts it using the
.B convergence.me3
profile file.
.SH OPTIONS
No options are accepted. The script takes no arguments.
.SH EXAMPLES
Launch the game with MangoHud:
.IP
.EX
launch-convergence.sh
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mangohud (1)
